MindCode resolves each provider credential environment-first, then from
the on-disk secret store (~/.config/mindcode/credentials.json).

Every provider is a custom profile you add yourself with `mindcode provider`;
there is no built-in provider.  Each profile needs a name, base_url, protocol
(openai-compatible or anthropic-compatible), and a credential key you store
with `mindcode settings key`.

The legacy OAuth setup flow is not used by MindCode.
